                        "severity": "Medium",
                        "reasoning": "The class `JWTQuiz` is a `@RestController`, which is a singleton by default in Spring. The `guesses` array is a shared mutable instance variable. Multiple concurrent users accessing the `/JWT/quiz` endpoint will read from and write to the same `guesses` array. This leads to a race condition where one user's progress or results can be overwritten or leaked to other users, as there is no synchronization or request-scoped storage for this state.",
